5.2 Pretrained model weights

  A time-series foundation model checkpoint is optionally baked into the image at
  build time (see CHRONOS_MODEL_ID in src/training_runtime/Dockerfile). Model
  weights carry their own license, which is independent of this project's MIT-0
  license and of the library that loads them. Check the model card of whichever
  checkpoint you configure before redistributing an image that contains it.

5.3 Base image and package mirrors

  The base image is public.ecr.aws/docker/library/python (PSF-licensed CPython in
  a Debian userland, each component under its own license). Package mirrors are
  configurable build arguments; the mirror you choose does not change the
